{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21726","headline":"以州宅夸於乐天 · 元稹","name":"以州宅夸於乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州城迥遶拂云堆，镜水稽山满眼来。\n四面常时对屏障，一家终日在楼台。\n星河似向檐前落，鼓角惊从地底廻。\n我是玉皇香案吏，谪居犹得住蓬莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}